    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the environmental conservation law, in relation to the distribution of certain ivory articles and rhinoceros horns to a museum authorized by special charter from the legislature of the state",
    "basePrintNo": "S7916",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7916-2013",
